<title>UK: London gold finishes off low but vulnerable.</title>
<headline>London gold finishes off low but vulnerable.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $334.10/$334.60 down $2.80 but off floor. Quiet only mild physical interest. Very bearish, seen moving lower. Hong Kong closed Tuesday.</p>
<p>SILVER - Also ended off floor at $4.66/$4.68, down five cents.</p>
<p>Sold off on Comex opening, steadied.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Finished up $8.00 at $424.00/$429.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ended down about $2.00 at $190.00/$195.00.</p>
</text>
